Author: Kotoba3DS

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: Kotoba3DS

Summary: In-game Japanese dictionary that saves words for Anki

Description: |
  Look up Japanese words while you play (romaji input, conjugated
  forms, kanji by components) and save them with a screenshot.
  tools/mine.py on your PC turns the saved words into Anki cards.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
